msgstr "Na Spaceship: API Manager > New API key."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Spaceship.php
msgid "Manages domains on Spaceship through its API. Create the API key in the Spaceship API Manager with the permissions domains:read, domains:write, domains:transfer, domains:billing, contacts:write and asyncoperations:read. Registrations, transfers and renewals are charged to your Spaceship account. Spaceship auto-renewal is off for every domain registered or transferred here: ClientFence renews a domain when its renewal invoice is paid. Spaceship has no test system: keep test mode off."
msgstr "Upravlja domenama na Spaceship putem njegovog API sučelja. API ključ izradite u Spaceship API Manager s dopuštenjima domains:read, domains:write, domains:transfer, domains:billing, contacts:write i asyncoperations:read. Registracije, prijenosi i obnove naplaćuju se s vašeg Spaceship računa. Automatska obnova na Spaceship isključena je za svaku domenu registriranu ili prenesenu ovdje: ClientFence obnavlja domenu kada se plati račun za obnovu. Spaceship nema testni sustav: testni način rada držite isključenim."

